(
    title: "Dragonfire",
    developer: Some("Bob Smith"),
    description: Some("Two screens alternate per level: a side-view sprint across the drawbridge, ducking high fireballs and hopping low ones, then a top-down treasure hall where a dragon patrols the doorway spitting fire as you sweep up the hoard. Both you and the fireballs get faster each level; seven lives stand between the prince and a very warm end. Arkie Certificate of Merit for its audio-visual effects."),
